WEBVTT

00:05:58.699 --> 00:06:04.915
These kinds of target-based practices
also help kids develop

00:06:04.939 --> 00:06:07.561
attention and concentration skills,

00:06:07.585 --> 00:06:09.224
so those are great.

00:06:09.248 --> 00:06:13.308
Number [four]: Deconstruct appliances.

00:06:14.064 --> 00:06:17.976
There is a world of interesting things
inside your dishwasher.

00:06:18.000 --> 00:06:21.904
Next time you're about
to throw out an appliance,

00:06:21.928 --> 00:06:23.085
don't throw it out.

00:06:23.109 --> 00:06:24.523
Take it apart with your kid,

00:06:24.547 --> 00:06:27.908
or send him to my school,
and we'll take it apart with them.

00:06:27.932 --> 00:06:30.204
Even if you don't know what the parts are,